s associated with relevant investment products through the new system.","unit_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528"},{"quote":"1 Investment-linked assurance schemes, mandatory provident fund products, open-ended fund companies, paper gold schemes, pooled retirement funds, real estate investment trusts, unit trusts and mutual funds and unlisted structured investment products.","unit_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26.u16.2270"}],"distinction":"Submission-event routing is the strongest supported reading: the text covers applications and submissions without limiting the mandate to newly opened cases. A new-cases-only alternative would materially spare later filings in existing cases, but the supplied text does not support that exception sufficiently to formalize it as a competing reading. The strongest uncertainty is transitional treatment in unavailable referenced material.","family":"scope","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"Whether the selected event is an application or submission to IPD concerning an investment product administered by IPD, interpreted with the listed product categories. Classification of borderline events requires judgment.","name":"is_covered_submission","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0","d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528","d19f9ecf9fd26.u16.2270"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"Gregorian date of the selected submission event. Selecting the operative event for attempted, incomplete or continued filings may require judgment.","name":"submission_date","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0","d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528"],"type":"date","unit":"Gregorian calendar date"},{"meaning":"Whether the selected application or submission was submitted to IPD through e-IP.","name":"submitted_via_e_ip","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0","d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"submitted_via_e_ip","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and is_covered_submission (>= submission_date (date 2024-11-30)))"},"local_id":"reading_1","questions":["Does the earlier circular provide a transitional rule for pending cases or an exception for particular submission types?","Which operational event fixes the date when a filing spans the cutover?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] For a covered submission dated on or after 30 November 2024, true means the selected mandatory e-IP routing control is met because that submission used e-IP; false means that routing control is unmet. Outside the stated scope, this result makes no compliance determination. Unknown coverage, dates or channel facts remain unknown.","subject":"Mandatory e-IP routing for one IPD application or submission"},"protocol":"legalmath.search.v1","role":"adversarial-investigator","source_packet":{"authority":"RETAINED_SOURCE","dependencies":[{"dependency_id":"missing.4ad6b317ad4ade41b82f120a","source_hash":null}],"family_ids":["scope","definitions","exceptions","modality","time","dependencies"],"selected_slice":"Mandatory e-IP route for applications/submissions administered by IPD, with the extended 30 November 2024 cutover.","source_key":"assurance.3fb3cb241815dcbd7d3d754b","units":[{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC50 chars 0:424","normative":true,"span":{"end":424,"id":"s.d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0","page":1,"quote_sha256":"70ee7250eeb7b965a9f36fea7033b47195b54623f1df2b278429b9ad341b7041","raw_sha256":"fbd54d2f2ef063334df5c30ae20bc4bc47fc332a8b201a10730cd242055ea1a4","source_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26","start":0,"text_sha256":"31ea1ec5eb95fa7f7f9dcb9e090d3a2f3fe4754a01c2613bc94c4741f749dba3"},"text":"This circular informs the industry that the Securities and Futures Commission (SFC) will extend the parallel run period of its new online application/submission system for investment products, e-IP, by one month to 29 November 2024. After the extended period, applications and submissions of investment products administered by the Investment Products Division (IPD)1 must be submitted to IPD via e-IP from 30 November 2024.","unit_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC50 chars 427:437","normative":true,"span":{"end":437,"id":"s.d19f9ecf9fd26.u1.427","page":1,"quote_sha256":"ea2b8a878841df5955c78edc6cae47446483b86e3f5ccb04e1a8d940cf7e59fd","raw_sha256":"fbd54d2f2ef063334df5c30ae20bc4bc47fc332a8b201a10730cd242055ea1a4","source_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26","start":427,"text_sha256":"31ea1ec5eb95fa7f7f9dcb9e090d3a2f3fe4754a01c2613bc94c4741f749dba3"},"text":"Background","unit_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26.u1.427"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC50 chars 439:734","normative":true,"span":{"end":734,"id":"s.d19f9ecf9fd26.u2.439","page":1,"quote_sha256":"6dd2652b9a49ce7c352f98e5230cf5742e20f2ed218efc06086398f209c8be86","raw_sha256":"fbd54d2f2ef063334df5c30ae20bc4bc47fc332a8b201a10730cd242055ea1a4","source_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26","start":439,"text_sha256":"31ea1ec5eb95fa7f7f9dcb9e090d3a2f3fe4754a01c2613bc94c4741f749dba3"},"text":"Following the “Circular on launch of e-IP application/submission system on WINGS” dated 8 July 2024, the SFC launched e-IP on its WINGS2 portal on 29 July 2024 to streamline and enhance the efficiency of processing new product applications and post-authorisation/registration submissions to IPD.","unit_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26.u2.439"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC50 chars 737:954","normative":true,"span":{"end":954,"id":"s.d19f9ecf9fd26.u3.737","page":1,"quote_sha256":"5485d462df3cc79af89f6c4cf8e4463555ef205796f5e9e410f0a36a68d037a2","raw_sha256":"fbd54d2f2ef063334df5c30ae20bc4bc47fc332a8b201a10730cd242055ea1a4","source_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26","start":737,"text_sha256":"31ea1ec5eb95fa7f7f9dcb9e090d3a2f3fe4754a01c2613bc94c4741f749dba3"},"text":"A three-month period of parallel run from the launch of e-IP up to 29 October 2024 was provided at the initial stage. During this period, the SFC continues to accept applications and submissions via existing channels.","unit_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26.u3.737"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC50 chars 956:1011","normative":true,"span":{"end":1011,"id":"s.d19f9ecf9fd26.u4.956","page":1,"quote_sha256":"54513ae6db769b044b5e307776db8b64749d00e78e99c8023eec503d86cbd09b","raw_sha256":"fbd54d2f2ef063334df5c30ae20bc4bc47fc332a8b201a10730cd242055ea1a4","source_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26","start":956,"text_sha256":"31ea1ec5eb95fa7f7f9dcb9e090d3a2f3fe4754a01c2613bc94c4741f749dba3"},"text":"Parallel run period extension and upcoming enhancements","unit_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26.u4.956"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC50 chars 1013:1185","normative":true,"span":{"end":1185,"id":"s.d19f9ecf9fd26.u5.1013","page":1,"quote_sha256":"ae8025e775a524055d7dde8da0a2413c689018f34c1c186de6f9be553d7f51d4","raw_sha256":"fbd54d2f2ef063334df5c30ae20bc4bc47fc332a8b201a10730cd242055ea1a4","source_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26","start":1013,"text_sha256":"31ea1ec5eb95fa7f7f9dcb9e090d3a2f3fe4754a01c2613bc94c4741f749dba3"},"text":"Since its implementation, the SFC has closely monitored the functioning of e-IP and actively engaged with industry participants to obtain their feedback on user experience.","unit_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26.u5.1013"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC50 chars 1187:1503","normative":true,"span":{"end":1503,"id":"s.d19f9ecf9fd26.u6.1187","page":1,"quote_sha256":"9c3d8ebc66be0cb7e3a70941a0d925f4220ca2db57fde8edf06bd65d69366155","raw_sha256":"fbd54d2f2ef063334df5c30ae20bc4bc47fc332a8b201a10730cd242055ea1a4","source_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26","start":1187,"text_sha256":"31ea1ec5eb95fa7f7f9dcb9e090d3a2f3fe4754a01c2613bc94c4741f749dba3"},"text":"While e-IP has garnered widespread industry support and is running smoothly, new features and more advanced settings will be introduced to further enhance user experience based on users’ comments. To facilitate these enhancements, the SFC will extend the parallel run period of e-IP by one month to 29 November 2024.","unit_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26.u6.1187"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC50 chars 1505:1526","normative":true,"span":{"end":1526,"id":"s.d19f9ecf9fd26.u7.1505","page":1,"quote_sha256":"f8ea1bb0c6eb553da747db18a062061d29ce9c517ac82d03266b19472652bdd8","raw_sha256":"fbd54d2f2ef063334df5c30ae20bc4bc47fc332a8b201a10730cd242055ea1a4","source_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26","start":1505,"text_sha256":"31ea1ec5eb95fa7f7f9dcb9e090d3a2f3fe4754a01c2613bc94c4741f749dba3"},"text":"Full adoption of e-IP","unit_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26.u7.1505"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC50 chars 1528:2009","normative":true,"span":{"end":2009,"id":"s.d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528","page":1,"quote_sha256":"69a8f8c21086c4223a4406cea95c3b870ea3b3fd7db8affa2d78a0c4ea0977d1","raw_sha256":"fbd54d2f2ef063334df5c30ae20bc4bc47fc332a8b201a10730cd242055ea1a4","source_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26","start":1528,"text_sha256":"31ea1ec5eb95fa7f7f9dcb9e090d3a2f3fe4754a01c2613bc94c4741f749dba3"},"text":"Starting 30 November 2024, ie, after the parallel run period, applications and submissions of investment products administered by IPD must be submitted via e-IP. The current submission requests from IPD via the IP E-submission system will be integrated into e-IP, including reporting of net asset values, large redemptions and suspensions of dealing. In addition, e-IP users can also settle recurring annual fees associated with relevant investment products through the new system.","unit_id":"d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=24EC50 chars 2011:2033","normative":true,"span":{"end":2033,"id":"s.d19f9ecf9fd26.u9.2011","page":1,"quote_sha256":"a84bc14b3eb8ea57129a0ba9ad1d7188a5ca29171867d4d394efa4bdab6b14e5","raw_sha256":"fbd54d2f2ef063334df5